irst person to fly solo across the Pacific from Honolulu to California.</p>Amelia Earhart has accomplished many things in the field of aviation.  In 1937, she was ready for her biggest challenge. She was confident and determined to be the first woman to fly around the world. On June 1st, Earhart and her navigator Fred Noonan departed from Miami and began a long journey but never returned."}, {"time": "57000", "image": "engenn6le02ob10re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "A rescue attempt was carried out by the American government reluctantly called it off. In 1938, a lighthouse was constructed on Howland Island in her memory. Her birthplace, Atchison, Kansas, has turned into a virtual shrine in her memory."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}